config ATM_BROWNOUT
	bool "Enable brownout support"
	default y if PM

if ATM_BROWNOUT

config BROWNOUT_IMMEDIATELY
        bool "Trigger brownout power-off immediately in ISR"
        default y
        help
            When enabled, the brownout power-off sequence (brwnout_plf_off())
            is executed immediately in the PMU interrupt handler instead of
            being deferred to a workqueue.

            This also suppresses the PMU status register read and print that
            is otherwise emitted during the power-off sequence.

endif
